1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,320
总算到了
There she is.

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:05,432
老图书馆 曾在里面度过漫漫长夜啊
The old library. That's some late nights in there.

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:08,460
的确有些夜晚是在学习呢 别告诉老妈
Some of them I even spent studying. Don't tell your mom.

4
00:00:08,777 --> 00:00:10,667
那就不该告诉我
And maybe don't tell me.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,480
大学生
College!

6
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,500
他举起手是为了挡阳光 免得晃眼
He was shielding his eyes from the sun.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,720
击掌时才反应过来
Knew it when I hit it.

8
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,700
菲尔要带海莉拜访他的母校
Phil is taking Haley to visit his alma mater.

9
00:00:18,977 --> 00:00:20,967
深爱的大学
Loved college.

10
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:24,437
我们希望父亲的激情也激起女儿对大学的向往
Mm, we were hoping some of that enthusiasm rubs off on her.

11
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,620
加油 "斗牛蛙"队
Go Bullfrogs!

12
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:26,840
是斗牛犬队
Dogs!

13
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:28,560
斗牛犬队
Bulldogs!

14
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:29,940
我觉得你是故意的
I feel like you do that on purpose.

15
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,300
不 只是
No, it's just...

16
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,420
我知道是"斗牛" 就是忘记是"蛙"还是"犬"了
I say "bull", and I can't remember it's frogs or dogs.

17
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,420
我跟大学哥们打电话时
When I talk to my old branch from college.

18
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,120
我们是"呱呱"叫 还是"汪汪"叫
do we croak or do we bark?

19
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,020
我来接
I got it.

20
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,360
喂
Hello?

21
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,280
不是吧
No way!

22
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:54,700
不是吧 海莉 快来看
Haley, no way! Check it out!

23
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,300
我和哥们喝完啤酒后 会跳到这些午餐盘上
After a few beers, my buds and I would jump on these lunch trays

24
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,800
就从这坡上比赛滑下去 上来试试
and race down this same hill. Hop on.

25
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,860
-我不想试 -不骗你 你马上就会傻乐
- I don't want to to hop on. - Seriously, you'll get the giggles.

26
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:01,980
我不想傻乐
I don't want the giggles.

27
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,340
喂 亲爱的
Hey, honey.

28
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:07,140
-游览进行得怎样 -非常好
- How's the trip going? - So good.

29
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,400
加油 斗牛蛙队
Go, Bullfrogs.

30
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:11,460
是"犬"
It's dogs.

31
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,540
不好意思
Oh, sorry.

32
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:13,560
海莉表现怎样
How's Haley doing?

33
00:01:15,580 --> 00:01:15,980
她啊
She's...

34
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:19,480
她喜欢 她喜欢这里
She's loving it. She's loving it.

35
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:22,940
我带她去看了学生会 参观了宿舍
I showed her the student union. We visited the dorms.

36
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:25,140
我们去教室听了节课
We sat in on a class.

37
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:28,260
我觉得她开始发现大学的美好了
I really think she's starting to see what college has to offer.

38
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,000
克莱尔 稍等
Oh, hang on, Claire.

39
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,120
加油 斗牛犬
Go, Bulldogs!

40
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:50,060
曼尼 这个叫贝拉的女孩是谁
Manny, who is this Bella girl?

41
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:52,300
你的笔记本上怎么满是她的名字
And why is her name all over your notebook?

42
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:53,920
妈 贝拉已经不是小女孩了
Bella's no girl, mom.

43
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:57,340
她最近开苞了 就像四月的丁香花
She has recently blossomed, like a purple lilac in April.

44
00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:59,128
你说的"开苞"是什么意思
What do you mean, she blossom?

45
00:01:59,648 --> 00:02:00,763
春情躁动期吗
Like, the poo-berty?

46
00:02:00,773 --> 00:02:01,792
没错
Yeah.

47
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,080
我去开门
I'll get it.

48
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,720
歌洛莉亚 你爱看的节目要开始了
Hey, Gloria, your show's about to start.

49
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,980
录下来吧
Record it.

50
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:08,380
不行 录像机都满了
No, the DVR's filling up.

51
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:10,560
咱就把它看完算了
Let's just watch and get it over with.

52
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,740
歌洛莉亚总是说
Gloria's always saying

53
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:13,260
我们应该多些夫妻共享时光
we should do more stuff together.

54
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:14,900
所以我答应看她喜欢的这部
So I agreed to watch this

55
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,260
疯狂的哥伦比亚肥皂剧
crazy Colombian soap opera she loves.

56
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,720
《肥龟爷髅》
"Fuego y hielo."

57
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:22,340
显然 就是"长发鬼之乱吼"的西班牙语叫法
Which apparently, is Spanish for "Big hair and yelling."

58
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:23,920
"水深火热"
"Fire and ice."

59
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:25,580
讲的是人间疾苦
It's about human suffering.

60
00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:27,320
人家可喜欢了
I relate to it.

61
00:02:27,713 --> 00:02:30,688
我是说 那家伙是个法官 总该穿件衣裳
I'm just saying, the guy's a judge. He can put a shirt on.

62
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:33,480
哎呀 那是什么
Ay, what is that?

63
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,340
没什么
Oh, nothing.

64
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:37,260
那可不像"没什么"哦 里面是什么
That doesn't look like a nothing. What is inside?

65
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,680
只是我买的点东西
Oh, it's just something I bought.

66
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,120
我回房间再拆开
I'm gonna go open it in my room.

67
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,980
可不是什么好现象啊
I don't like this.

68
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:45,640
曼尼从来不背着我有小秘密
Manny has never kept a secret from me.

69
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:46,540
别担心
Don't worry about it.

70
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:48,780
你觉得那是什么东西
What do you think it could be?

71
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,040
我现在担心那东西
Well, right now I'm a little worried

72
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,540
能让你一整晚烦着我
it could be the rest of my evening.

73
00:02:53,515 --> 00:02:54,469
再见 我爱你
Mwah! Bye-bye. Love you.

74
00:02:54,469 --> 00:02:56,320
克莱尔 等等 你有兴趣
Hey, Claire, listen. Uh, if you want,

75
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,200
和其他几位妈妈一起 共赏《乱世佳人》吗
some of the moms are gonna stay and watch "Gone with the wind"

76
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,420
在我家的新放映室哦
in my new screening room.

77
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:01,380
有葡萄酒喝哦
I got pinot!

78
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:03,540
我很乐意 可我身体不太舒服
I would love to, but I'm not feeling that great,

79
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:05,800
所以我还是回家歇着吧
so I'm probably just gonna go home and rest.

80
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,920
况且我看过这电影了
Plus I've seen that movie.

81
00:03:07,340 --> 00:03:08,640
没 我从来没看过《乱世佳人》
No, I never saw "Gone with the Wind,"

82
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:10,680
但我的俩孩子今晚不回家睡
But I have two kids at sleepovers,

83
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,440
而且菲尔带海莉去外地了
And Haley's out of town with Phil.

84
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,500
所以今晚就我一个人在家
That means I have one night to myself,

85
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,040
这是千载难逢的好机会啊
which happens once every never.

86
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:17,860
我可不会去和那帮
I am not spending it

87
00:03:17,860 --> 00:03:20,200
高中时就跟我有仇的八卦妈妈们混一晚上
with some gossipy mom who was mean to me in high school.

88
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:23,180
今晚我要出去找点乐子
I need a fun night out.

89
00:03:23,509 --> 00:03:24,220
真棒
Yes.

90
00:03:24,220 --> 00:03:26,560
这是什么鬼地方 不对
What the hell is this? No.

91
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,380
我是叫你们带我体验狂欢之夜 不是来这儿
I asked you guys for a fun night out, not this.

92
00:03:29,380 --> 00:03:32,860
我要的是纵情歌舞 乌烟瘴气
I-I-I need music and dancing and secondhand smoke.

93
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,820
求你试试这儿吧 绝对超值
Oh, please give this place a chance. It's a great value.

94
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:35,860
这儿环境舒适
The room is so cozy.

95
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:38,660
肉馅饼好吃得要命
And the potpies are to die for.

96
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:40,420
你不觉得你刚说的那些无聊到死吗
Are you really comfortable with what you just said?

97
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:42,640
拜托 我的派对达人是怎么了
Come on. What happened to the party people

98
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:45,120
你们以前还带我去锐舞派对 让我穿"魔力挺"
who took me to a rave, and I got to wear a tube top,

99
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,480
我还往艳舞男孩的小内裤里塞钱呢
and I stuffed cash in a caged go-go boy's speedo?

100
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,860
我们依旧是派对达人
We're still party people.

101
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:51,080
乔安 能给我来杯潘趣酒吗[无酒精]
Oh, Joanne, before I forget, can I get a punch?

102
00:03:51,254 --> 00:03:53,208
差一杯就能有一份免费馅饼了
One away from a free potpie.

103
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:54,860
如果那是你们的基佬卡 就该吊销了
If that was your gay card, it would be revoked.

104
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:55,960
克莱尔 你知道吗
Okay, you know what, Claire?

105
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,680
你有点儿像回到高中时代了
You're being a little high school you.

106
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,060
米奇尔 对不起 但我难得一夜自由
I am sorry, Mitchell, but I get one free night,

107
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:01,440
我不能把一晚上浪费在这
And I can't spend it at a place

108
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,680
威尔森小学的荣誉赞助餐馆
that is a proud supporter of Wilson Elementary.

109
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,200
我们都该回馈社会才对 克莱尔
We all need to give back, Claire.

110
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:06,280
把大好夜晚"回馈"给我吧
Give me back my night.

111
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:09,800
好吧 朗吉纳斯邀请我们去个精品店的开业晚宴
Okay, well, Longinus did invite us to a boutique opening,

112
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,300
你懂的 有鸡尾酒和音乐
You know, cocktails, DJ.

113
00:04:11,706 --> 00:04:14,500
但是会很疯很闹的
But it'll--it'll be a whole scene, though.

114
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:16,780
闹啊 闹好啊 棒极了
A scene? A scene is perfect. That's great.

115
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:18,480
趁你们还没改变主意 咱们赶紧上车
I will get in the car before you guys change your mind.

116
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,952
快 走吧 出发
Come on. Let's go. Let's go.

117
00:04:20,334 --> 00:04:21,987
这么说没馅饼吃咯
So does that mean no potpies?

118
00:04:22,006 --> 00:04:24,176
乔安 两个九号的打包
Uh, hey, Joanne? Two number nines to go.

119
00:04:25,380 --> 00:04:26,360
没说错吧
Was I wrong?

120
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:28,780
敢说这鸡翅不是你平生未尝的美味吗
Are these not the best wings you've ever had in your life?

121
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:31,340
-赞不绝口啊 -你还说吃不了40个
- Oh, my god. - And you didn't wanna get 40.

122
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:34,320
顺便说 这只是美好夜晚的开始喔
Oh, and by the way, this is just the start of your evening.

123
00:04:34,780 --> 00:04:36,020
下一个节目 去方庭
Next up, it's over to the quad

124
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:38,200
欣赏一组男高音表演 要跟我去吗
for a musical interlude from tenors, anyone?

125
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:40,400
-是一个全男性声乐团... -我懂的
- It's an all-male singing group... - Got it.

126
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,000
喂 你好
Oh, hey!

127
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:44,720
你不是今早在我游览队伍里那个吗
Oh, hey. Weren't you on my tour this morning?

128
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,629
对 我叫海莉 这是我老...
Yeah, I'm Haley, and this is my d--

129
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,300
老哥 你信了你信了
Big brother. You bought it for a second.

130
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:50,564
你好吗 噢糟糕
How are you? Oh, oops.

131
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:53,500
好吧 不管怎样 你知道吗
Okay. Anyway, you know what?

132
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:55,500
今晚有个学生联谊会
There is a student mixer going on tonight.

133
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,679
你想去的话 我和其他一些女孩
If you wanna go, me and a bunch of other girls

134
00:04:56,679 --> 00:04:57,564
打算一起过去
are gonna head over there.

135
00:04:57,564 --> 00:05:01,600
噢 那个 我想说 还是算了
Oh! Uh, you know what? That's okay.

136
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,440
我老爸都计划好了
My dad's got this whole thing planned...

137
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,540
不管怎样多谢了
but thank you anyway.

138
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,400
客气 很高兴见到你
No problem. Well, it was nice meeting you.

139
00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:07,240
我也是
Nice meeting you.

140
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:11,300
多欢乐啊 就我们两个
How fun is this? Just me and you.

141
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,040
我有点紧张
I was a little nervous

142
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,800
怕你没看出这里的独特之处
you wouldn't see what's so special about this place.

143
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:17,060
我不是逼你一定要考这里 你知道 你
Not that I'm pushing you to come here. You know, you're--

144
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:19,328
你得自己做决定
You're gonna make your own decisions.

145
00:05:20,467 --> 00:05:22,080
你想跟她们一起去 是不是
You wanna go with them, don't you?

146
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:23,420
不 按我们的计划来
No, we're doing our thing.

147
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:25,400
去吧 晚了她们就走了
Yeah, quick. Before they leave.

148
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:27,400
-真的吗 -去吧 我搞得定
- Are you sure? - Go. I can handle it.

149
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,220
你又不是第一个在满是鸡腿的餐桌前
You're not the first girl to leave me at this table

150
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:31,169
离我而去的女孩子
with a plateful of chicken wings.

151
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:31,900
我开玩笑的
I'm kidding!

152
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,180
真希望我是开玩笑
I wish I was kidding.

153
00:05:34,425 --> 00:05:36,420
-我... -本不想让你听到的 好好玩
- I... - You weren't supposed to hear that. Have fun.

154
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:37,280
好的
Okay.

155
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,500
爱你喔
Love you.

156
00:05:38,780 --> 00:05:39,540
爱你喔
Love you.

157
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:48,460
鼻子整形了
Nose job.

158
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:51,340
提臀了
Butt lift.

159
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:53,480
去年夏天 那玩意儿都快垂到地面了
Last summer, that thing was 4 inches off the ground.

160
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,080
她们屁股上的赘肉都跑哪儿去了
What do they do with all the butt they take out?

161
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,380
我想我知道答案了
I have a theory.

162
00:05:59,555 --> 00:06:01,120
该死 我前男友来了
Oh, damn! Here comes my ex.

163
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,200
-谁啊 兰多夫吗 -还是马可斯
- Who? Randolph? - Marcus?

164
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,000
勒迈克尔吗
LaMichael?

165
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,460
不 是马特 我得走了
No. Matt. I gotta go.

166
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,640
狗血N角恋 好喜欢
Drama. Love it!

167
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:09,300
姐要的就是这个
This is what I wanted.

168
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:10,520
谁要再来一杯吗
Who needs a drink?

169
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,040
我还是要点矿泉水吧
I could use a little seltzer water.

170
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:12,980
再来点香槟吗 克莱尔
More bubbly, Claire?

171
00:06:12,980 --> 00:06:14,880
再来我就"槟至如归"了
Mm, I will be after I get a drink.

172
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:17,300
看 他那才叫好基友的风范嘛
See, that's what gay is supposed to be like.

173
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,480
你怎么样我不清楚
Okay, I don't know about you,

