345
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:28,420
这主意或许可行 他们看起来是有趣的人
It's not the craziest idea. They seem like fun people.

346
00:12:28,460 --> 00:12:30,600
-没错 也许我们能做伴侣好友 -对
- Yeah, and maybe we can be new couples friends with them. -Yeah.

347
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,440
我们可以一起去听演唱会
You know, we can go out to concerts,

348
00:12:32,460 --> 00:12:34,800
试吃新品 结伴豪华野营
try exciting new food, maybe do some luxury camping.

349
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:36,680
没错 让我们胸怀他们的大志
Yeah, hitch our wagon to their star

350
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:38,940
看他们激扬我们的人生
and see how fast they spice up our life.

351
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:39,980
你已经到了
You have arrived.

352
00:12:40,140 --> 00:12:41,340
我想也到了
I believe we have.

353
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,980
你个傻逼狗娘养的
You dumb son of a bitch!

354
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:47,220
-我的天啊 -我的天啊
- Oh, my god. - Oh, my god! Oh, my god!

355
00:12:47,220 --> 00:12:47,824
-我的天啊 -什么情况啊
Oh, my god! Oh, my god. What's happening?!

356
00:12:47,838 --> 00:12:50,235
你居然还敢回来 你个劈腿的王八蛋
I can't believe you came back here, you filthy, cheating pig!

357
00:12:50,255 --> 00:12:51,423
她在哪 她在哪
Where is she? Where is she?!

358
00:12:51,437 --> 00:12:52,433
倒车 快点
Back up, I said!

359
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,940
我正倒着呢 但我们"沉轨"了
I'm trying! We are in a rut!

360
00:12:54,997 --> 00:12:56,934
都这会了 你还想谈"成规"的事
Really? You wanna talk about that right now?

361
00:12:56,980 --> 00:13:00,020
不是 我们卡住了 车轮沉在轨里了
No, we are stuck! We're in an actual rut. We're stuck.

362
00:13:00,048 --> 00:13:02,065
我的天啊 我的天啊
Ohh! Oh, my god. Oh, my god!

363
00:13:02,103 --> 00:13:03,820
由爱生恨大发泄 我们惨成受害者
We are victims of a hate crime right now!

364
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:05,161
-走开 走开 -我的天啊
- Go! Go! -Oh, my god!

365
00:13:10,546 --> 00:13:12,094
不行 想都别想
Oh, no, you don't.

366
00:13:12,132 --> 00:13:13,192
爸 你在这干嘛啊
Dad, what are you doing here?

367
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:15,020
-这是什么 伙计 -姜汁汽水
- What's this, buddy. - Ginger ale.

368
00:13:15,043 --> 00:13:17,523
是吗 可这闻着像 还真像姜汁汽水
Oh, really? 'cause is smells-- okay, it smells like ginger ale.

369
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:18,600
但这说明不了什么
But that doesn't prove anything.

370
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:20,300
-你搞什么啊 -我们该走了
- What the hell? - We are leaving.

371
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:21,580
我正玩的尽兴呢
I'm having a nice time with--

372
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:23,960
和这个蠢蛋玩 顺便说一下 你也太老套了
With this clown? And by the way, it's a little cliche

373
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,880
找个和你老爸一个款型的男人
to pick someone who looks exactly like your dad.

374
00:13:25,933 --> 00:13:27,928
我知道你电话 小凯子
I got your number, pi chi.

375
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:30,120
-我认识你 -没错 你认识
- I know you. - Yeah, you do.

376
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:32,080
他叫本·福特 和我一个班的
This is Ben Ford. He's in my class.

377
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,000
他也是来参观的
He's visiting, too.

378
00:13:33,032 --> 00:13:34,747
你还教过我儿童棒球呢
You were my t-ball coach.

379
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:37,680
我爸是你的医生 他就在那
My dad's your doctor. He's right over there.

380
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:40,660
你有什么毛病啊
What is wrong with you?

381
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:43,220
你想把我大学生活扼杀在摇篮里吗
Are you trying to ruin college for me before I even get here?

382
00:13:43,220 --> 00:13:44,424
不 我不是
No, I-I'm not.

383
00:13:44,454 --> 00:13:46,255
不好意思 你不是什么蠢蛋
I am so sorry. You are not a clown.

384
00:13:46,738 --> 00:13:48,395
你是个很棒的候补游击手
You were an excellent backup shortstop.

385
00:13:48,734 --> 00:13:49,969
艾丽莎 布鲁斯
Alecia. Bruce.

386
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:51,720
加油 斗牛蛙 斗牛犬队
Go, Bullfrogs-- dogs!

387
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:53,040
加油 斗牛犬
Go, Bulldogs.

388
00:13:53,072 --> 00:13:54,638
克莱尔
Claire!

389
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,860
哇 真的吗
Wow. Really?

390
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:58,500
不是 只是很震惊啊
No, it's just a shock, is all.

391
00:13:58,528 --> 00:13:59,732
杰
Jay?

392
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:02,060
这么说西莉亚怀着法官的孩子
So Celia's carrying the judge's baby.

393
00:14:02,460 --> 00:14:04,640
怪不得她开枪射他 孕期狂躁
No wonder she shot him. She's hormonal.

394
00:14:04,676 --> 00:14:06,624
-你跟谁打电话呢 -管家而已
- Who are you talking to? -The housekeeper.

395
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:09,220
玛利亚 我得挂了 多谢剧透
Maria, I've gotta go. Thanks a lot.

396
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,920
杰 我想让你和曼尼谈谈
Jay, I need you to talk to manny.

397
00:14:12,100 --> 00:14:14,520
-怎么了 -他如果真在干你说的那事
- What? - Well, if he's doing what you think he's doing,

398
00:14:14,548 --> 00:14:16,111
那他需要和一个男人谈谈
Then he needs to talk to a man.

399
00:14:16,130 --> 00:14:18,040
我不想让他感到难堪啊
I don't want him to be ashame of anything.

400
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,220
那么你就不应该让我去
Then you don't want to send me in there.

401
00:14:19,262 --> 00:14:21,755
是啊 但如果他有什么疑问呢
Yeah, but what if-- if he has questions?

402
00:14:21,808 --> 00:14:23,316
如果他不知道该怎么
What if he doesn't know how to--

403
00:14:23,348 --> 00:14:24,919
歌洛莉亚 不论他在经历什么
Gloria, Gloria, whatever he's going through,

404
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,320
他都能自己领悟的
he can work it out himself.

405
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,040
救命 我卡住了
Help! I'm stuck!

406
00:14:28,071 --> 00:14:30,302
不 杰 快去 我求你了
Ay, no, Jay, go. I beg of you!

407
00:14:30,353 --> 00:14:31,469
-快走 快走 -歌洛莉亚
- Go! Go! Go! - Gloria.

408
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,620
我真不愿做这事儿
I'm extremely reluctant to do this.

409
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:34,600
拜托 快点啦
Please hurry!

410
00:14:34,638 --> 00:14:37,389
不行 这是"妇女不宜"内容
Ay, no. I cannot look at this.

411
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,960
搞什么啊
What the hell?

412
00:14:39,180 --> 00:14:40,400
我下不来了 杰
I can't get down, Jay.

413
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,540
怎么了 曼尼出什么事了
What? What happened to Manny?!

414
00:14:43,578 --> 00:14:46,180
-快告诉我出什么事了啊 -歌洛莉亚
-Ay, somebody say something to me! -Gloria,

415
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:46,860
没事
It's okay.

416
00:14:46,886 --> 00:14:48,117
进来吧
Come on in.

417
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:48,640
好的
Okay.

418
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,640
他刚才倒挂在这横梁上了
He was hanging from that bar up there.

419
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:54,620
啥 为什么啊 你头上戴的什么东西
What? Why? What do you have on your head?

420
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:56,880
加重头盔 通过伸展身体来让我长高
It's a weighted helmet to stretch me so I can get taller.

421
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:01,100
曼尼 你为什么非要长高啊
Manny! Why do you have to get tall now?

422
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,760
为了爱情 妈妈 还会为什么
Love, mom. Why else?

423
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,400
我的贝拉跟德克斯跑了
I lost Bella to Durkus because,

424
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,160
按她的话说就是"人家好高啊"
in her words, "He's tall."

425
00:15:06,860 --> 00:15:08,600
班里的同学都越长越高 除了我
Everybody else is getting taller but me.

426
00:15:08,980 --> 00:15:09,900
你觉得这是咖啡惹的祸吗
You think it's the coffee?

427
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:10,500
不是
No.

428
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:12,720
有可能 但是
Maybe. But--

429
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,279
可是你这样"倒挂金钟"也是做无用功啊
But hanging downside up is not gonna help you.

430
00:15:15,316 --> 00:15:16,660
网上说可以的
The web site said it would.

431
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,040
听着 曼尼
Listen, manny,

432
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:22,380
你已经集美貌 智慧 风趣于一身了
You're already intelligent and beautiful and funny.

433
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:25,380
如果你再长高点 你就过于完美了
If you get tall, you're going to have everything,

434
00:15:25,425 --> 00:15:26,866
其他那些歪瓜裂枣
And those poor boys

435
00:15:26,911 --> 00:15:30,097
怎么再和你相提并论呢
Are not gonna have anything to compete with you.

436
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,340
看看这
Look at this.

437
00:15:31,369 --> 00:15:33,548
你头上都有个伤痕了
You have a mark on your head now.

438
00:15:33,577 --> 00:15:35,938
我给你拿些冰来 好不好
I'm gonna go get you some ice, okay?

439
00:15:37,100 --> 00:15:39,440
话倒挺好听的 可我明天怎么办啊
That's a lot of pretty words, but they don't help me tomorrow.

440
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,320
抱歉 孩子 都浮云而已
Sorry, kid. It's just one of those things.

441
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,340
该长高时候自然就会长高
You get taller when you get taller.

442
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:45,280
你应该睡觉了吧
Why don't you get ready for bed?

443
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,600
老天
Ah, jeez.

444
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:55,780
我像你这么大的时候
You know, when I was your age,

445
00:15:55,780 --> 00:15:57,760
我靠健身来吸引女生
I started working out to get the girls.

446
00:15:58,100 --> 00:15:58,960
你觉得有用吗
You think that would help?

447
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:02,100
没错 明天 我们一起去健身
Yeah. So tomorrow, we start working out.

448
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:02,580
好不好
Okay?

449
00:16:03,801 --> 00:16:05,432
要不然我来给你做几个引体向上
Maybe I'll even show you a few pull-ups

450
00:16:05,483 --> 00:16:07,812
就在这玩意上面
On, uh, this bad boy here, huh?

451
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:13,820
你看见没
You see that?

452
00:16:13,883 --> 00:16:18,622
过不了多久 你也能 这么壮
Pretty soon, that's how strong... you're gonna be.

453
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,180
-谢了 妈妈 -嘘
- Thanks, mom. - Shh!

454
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,100
-我不想让他们知道我在这 -好的
- I don't want them to know I was here. - Okay.

455
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:24,420
克莱尔 我就知道是你
Oh, Claire, I thought that was you.

456
00:16:24,460 --> 00:16:25,480
谢天谢地 快进来
Thank god. Come in.

457
00:16:25,525 --> 00:16:28,387
不行 因为我病了 记得不 抱歉
I can't. 'cause I'm sick, remember? Sorry.

458
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:29,720
其实 我DVD机坏了
Well, my DVD player just broke,

459
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,120
我们都没看到《乱世佳人》的结局是什么
and none of us know how "Gone With the Wind" Ends.

460
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:31,940
但你看过 对吧
But you saw it, right?

461
00:16:31,973 --> 00:16:33,338
-是克莱尔吗 -是
- Oh, is that Claire? - Yeah.

462
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,400
能告诉我们结局吗
Can you tell us what happened?

463
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,940
我能 但我不想给你们剧透啊
I could, but I don't want to ruin it for you.

464
00:16:36,978 --> 00:16:38,890
不会 我们真的想知道 我们真的想
No, we really need to know. We need to know.

465
00:16:38,890 --> 00:16:41,682
克莱尔 快告诉我们吧
Claire. Just tell us. -Um...

466
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:45,280
郝思嘉真的很生克拉克·盖博的气
Scarlett is... really mad at Clark Gable

467
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:48,560
因为他说了很多不好听的话
Because, um, he says so many bad things.

468
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:51,600
是不是 还把 一农场什么的给点了
And didn't he, um, burn down a farm or something?

469
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,660
克莱尔 你是不是醉了
Claire, have you been drinking?

470
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,800
我喝了点苏格兰热托地 喉咙有点不舒服
I had a hot toddy. Made one for my throat.

471
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:01,200
晚上卧床的话 你这也穿的太光鲜了吧
Pretty dressed up for a night in bed, right?

472
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:03,200
我只是随手拿了件衣服穿
Yeah, I-I just threw on the first thing I could find...

473
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,920
卢克打电话来时 正好那件就在椅子上
when Luke called, and it was just right there on the chair.

474
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:06,340
看她手上还盖着章呢
She has a stamp on her hand.

475
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:07,500
好吧
Okay. All right.

476
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,940
在大家点亮火把 群起而捉奸之前
Before we bust out the pitchforks and the torches,

477
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:11,200
可别忘了
May I remind you

478
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:13,120
我曾经帮你们把孩子都送回家
that I've driven every one of your children home

479
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,089
还急救过至少一个 贝瑟妮
and heimliched at least one, Bethenny.

480
00:17:15,140 --> 00:17:16,300
-大家好 -你好
- Hi. - Hello.

481
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,400
说来尴尬 我能借用下洗手间吗
This is totally inappropriate. But could I use your bathroom?

482
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:20,380
抱歉 你一直灌我喝酒
Sorry. You kept pushing the drinks.

483
00:17:20,439 --> 00:17:23,212
他是我朋友 同志朋友
I--friend. Gay friend. Gay.

484
00:17:23,252 --> 00:17:24,879
-我不是同志 -你必须得是
- I-I'm not gay. -Yes, you are.

485
00:17:24,918 --> 00:17:26,780
我不是同志 我只是法国人
I-I'm not gay. I'm--I'm french.

486
00:17:26,780 --> 00:17:27,500
你以为我是同志
You thought I was gay?

487
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:29,860
-你是认真的吗 -你对我是"认真的"吗
- Are you serious right now? - Well, are you?

488
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,320
你整晚都在投怀送抱
You've been throwing yourself at me all night.

489
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:33,191
哪有 我才没有呢
No, no. No, I have not.

490
00:17:33,191 --> 00:17:35,960
-贝瑟妮 拿葡萄酒来 有好戏看了 -贝瑟妮 别听她的
- Bethenny, grab the pinot. - Bethenny, do not grab the pinot.

491
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:39,260
你在我面前脱衣服 还捏我的手臂
You undressed in front of me. You squeezed my arm.

492
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,320
你还让我替你按摩 那些都算什么
You asked me for a massage. What was all that?

493
00:17:41,349 --> 00:17:45,441
那时我以为你是个同志
That was--that was me safely objectifying a gay person.

494
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,440
天哪 克莱尔
Wow, Claire!

495
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:49,060
当时我在年鉴里写"永远别变"
When I wrote "Don't ever change" in your yearbook,

496
00:17:49,060 --> 00:17:50,420
可不是这个意思啊
I didn't mean it like this.

497
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:52,160
放轻松 霍丽
Oh, ease up, Holly.

498
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:53,740
我是撒谎了
Okay, I lied.

499
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:57,760
我是撒谎了 我好不容易得到个自由之夜
I lied, but I get one night to myself,

500
00:17:57,760 --> 00:18:01,420
我只想和风趣的同志朋友纵情欢乐
and I just wanted to spend it with some fun gay people.

501
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,660
这人决定变直又不是我的错
It's not my fault this one decided to be straight.

502
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:04,820
我从来就是直的
I've always been straight.

503
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:05,960
你没资格说话
Oh, you don't get to talk!

504
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:08,020
我居然还向你咨询了时尚观点
I took fashion advice from you!

505
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:10,840
天哪 我穿这身衣服好看吗
Oh, my god. Do I even look good in this dress?

506
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,440
不 绝不问你了
No. Not you.

507
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:14,860
太短了 是吧
It's really short, isn't it?

508
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:15,900
的确
It's short.

509
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:16,520
是啊
Yeah.

510
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:19,240
求你了
Please?

511
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:21,960
求你了 就听我说几句
Please, just listen to me for one second.

512
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,880
离我远点 别跟着我
Go away! Stop following me!

513
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:26,000
能告诉我为何要骚扰这位女士吗
Hey, you wanna tell me why you're bothering this young lady?

514
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,380
不是的 警官 这是我女儿 快告诉他
Oh, no, no, no, no. Officer, this is my daughter. Tell him.

515
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:29,740
今晚 我根本不认识你
Tonight, I don't know who you are.

516
00:18:29,794 --> 00:18:32,128
她是在开玩笑
She's... she's joking.

517
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:33,220
我可不是危险人物
I'm not dangerous.

518
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:35,640
实际上 我还曾帮这条小路装过灯泡呢
In fact, I-I-I helped to put all the lights on this path.

519
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,260
20年前的事了
20 years ago,

520
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,340
我和朋友一些朋友参加完"维护女性"运动
some friends and I took back the night. So...

521
00:18:38,384 --> 00:18:39,694
我想我刚刚
I-I think I just...

522
00:18:39,750 --> 00:18:43,636
-有点让她难堪了 -只是有点吗
- I embarrassed her a little. - "A little"?

523
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,640
程度过轻 你那衣服才叫让我有点难堪
That sweatshirt embarrasses me "A little."

524
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:47,540
是女儿 鉴定完毕
Yep, that's a daughter.

525
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:50,400
今晚是怎么了
Tonight was insane.

526
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:52,080
你干吗要表现得那样
Why did you have to act like that?

527
00:18:52,140 --> 00:18:53,300
你正在参加一个派对
You were at that party.

528
00:18:53,336 --> 00:18:55,052
我看到你正和某个兄弟会男孩说活
I see you talking to frat boys, and--

529
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:58,100
这不就是此行的目的吗 感受大学校园
Isn't that why we're here, so I can experience college?

530
00:18:58,140 --> 00:19:00,440
要是我真来了大学 你会怎么做
I mean, what are you gonna do when I actually go?

531
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:03,820
不知道 也许会抓狂
I don't know. Freak out, I think.

532
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:07,380
听着
Look...

533
00:19:10,431 --> 00:19:12,906
你长这么大 都是我在保护你
Your whole life, my job has been to protect you--

534
00:19:13,401 --> 00:19:16,260
甜蜜的负担
A job I kinda love.

535
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,160
现在看来我不得不提前退休了
Now I feel like I'm being forced into early retirement.

536
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:22,980
我只是想找到你 确保你安然无恙
I just needed to find you and make sure you were okay...

537
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:27,480
坚守到最后一口气在
For as long as I still get to do that.

538
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,920
你总是这样
Just like you--

539
00:19:31,956 --> 00:19:35,394
惹我发火然后又让我感动
Piss me off and then say something sweet.

540
00:19:37,089 --> 00:19:40,139
我要到秋季才走呢
I'm not leaving until the fall.

541
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,680
也许那时能找到个方法
Maybe by then I can figure out

542
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,720
设计出什么东西保护着你
how to put a force field around you.

543
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:46,620
我一直在寻求解决之道
I've been working on that one

544
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:49,080
自从第一次帮你系安全带起就开始了
Since the first time I tried to fasten you into your car seat.

545
00:19:51,380 --> 00:19:53,200
当时我把你绑的太紧了
I pinched your chunky little thigh.

546
00:19:57,164 --> 00:20:00,881
虽然你这是在间接说我胖
Even though you basically just called me fat.

547
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:05,600
好了
So...

548
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:06,560
这真的很好玩吗
Is it really fun?

549
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:07,720
什么
What?

550
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:15,900
不会吧
No!

551
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,520
我们都纠结于为人之限
We all struggle with limitations...

552
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:21,020
有一些我们愿意接受
Some we're willing to accept...

553
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:23,074
我现在只想回家
You know, I just wanna be home,

554
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:24,860
靠着沙发读点书
reading on opposite ends of the sofa.

555
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,940
还有一些我们不愿接受
And some we're not.

556
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,700
我那样做太尴尬了
I'm so embarrassed I did that.

557
00:20:28,741 --> 00:20:31,060
你只是做那个 我们很欣慰
I'm just so happy that that was all it was.

558
00:20:31,101 --> 00:20:33,318
怎么 你以为我在做什么
Why? What'd you think I was doing?

559
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:36,060
永葆童心也未尝不可
It's never too late to grow in life.

560
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:37,150
天哪
Oh, my god!

561
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:41,780
有了我们的专利助长器
"Thanks to our patented lengthenator,

562
00:20:41,900 --> 00:20:44,820
您将最高能增高4英寸
you can increase your height by up to 4 inches."

563
00:20:44,853 --> 00:20:47,827
难以置信 他居然花了50美元来买
I can't believe he would spend $50 on this thing.

564
00:20:47,860 --> 00:20:48,580
就是嘛
I know.

565
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:51,636
这些钱都够他订两年的花花公子了
He could've got a 2-year subscription to "Playboy" For that.

566
00:20:51,679 --> 00:20:55,486
他不会去订什么花花公子
He's not getting the "Playboy" Ever! Ow!

567
00:20:55,540 --> 00:20:56,420
他只是个小孩
He's a little boy!

568
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:02,660
等我们明早起来会不会发现
Wouldn't it be great if we woke up tomorrow

569
00:21:02,660 --> 00:21:04,080
我们的车已经回来了
and our car had found its way home?

570
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:05,820
我觉得事情不会这么发展
Yeah, I feel that's not the way it's gonna happen.

571
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:07,200
我在农场就遇到过
Happened on the farm one time.

572
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:09,220
一场龙卷风卷走了我们的一头牛犊
A tornado scooped up one of our calves,

573
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:11,100
谁知道卷到哪去了 可六个月后
Dropped it who knows where. Six months later,

574
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:13,740
一头成年牛沿着车道走回来了
A full-grown cow comes walking up the driveway--

575
00:21:13,809 --> 00:21:15,153
一样的花纹 一样的叫声
Same markings, same moo.

576
00:21:15,194 --> 00:21:16,900
-那晚 我们 -我们大餐了一顿
- That night, we-- - We ate like kings.

577
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:18,260
之前我说过这故事
Okay, I've told it before.

578
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,740
我的天哪 那是我们的车
oh, my gosh! It's our car!

579
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:24,300
看来你们见过我老婆了
I see you've met my wife.
